message: "If you use this software or results, please cite the accompanying manuscript prepared for IEEE Transactions on Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems."
title: "TABDT: Trust and Age Bayesian Digital Twins reproducibility package"
type: software
version: "v19"
date-released: 2026-08-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/YassirALKarawi/tabdt-reproducibility"
url: "https://github.com/YassirALKarawi/tabdt-reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic simulation and external XJTU-SY validation package for trust
  and age Bayesian digital twins used in predictive maintenance under delayed,
  reordered, and dropped industrial packets. It accompanies a two-author
  manuscript prepared for IEEE Transactions on Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - predictive maintenance
  - remaining useful life
  - industrial cyber-physical systems
  - age of information
  - uncertainty quantification
